<title>USA: National Vision U.S. Dec sales up 10.5 pct.</title>
<headline>National Vision U.S. Dec sales up 10.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LAWRENCEVILLE, Ga. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$10.9	 $9.4	+16.0   +10.5</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $160.0     $138.0	+15.5   +4.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage. Figures for U.S. stores only and excluded Venture optical locations, which the company sold during foruth quarter of 1995 and first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Month is 4 weeks ended December 28.</p>
<p>Full company name is National Vision Associates Ltd.</p>
